    <data key="d0">GE Avio Expense Management Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D77FSUkPJ3o</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless and containerized application for internal expense tracking.</data>
    <data key="d3">Web Application Architecture</data>
